{
  "manifestVersion": 1,
  "revision": 1,
  "name": "customer-import-run",
  "description": "One customer-data import. A preview run writes nothing at all, so every row here belongs to an applied run. The idempotency key is business-derived from the system, the mapping fingerprint and the canonical digest of the rows - never from a clock or a random value - so a retry of the same payload returns this same run, and a different payload under the same key is a conflict rather than an adoption.",
